# NOTE:
# - The Vite frontend reads env from: cinemanager-web/.env
# - ASP.NET Core reads configuration from appsettings*.json and PROCESS environment variables.
#   A plain .env file is NOT loaded automatically unless you add a loader.
#
# Examples of ASP.NET Core environment variables you can export/set (optional):
# ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Server=(localdb)\\MSSQLLocalDB;Database=CinemaManagement;Trusted_Connection=True;MultipleActiveResultSets=true
# Jwt__Issuer=CineManager
# Jwt__Audience=CineManager.Web
# Jwt__Secret=CHANGE_ME_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_SECRET_FOR_PRODUCTION_2026
# Jwt__AccessTokenMinutes=60
# Jwt__RefreshTokenDays=14
